  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/0FLZ">Lemma <span data-tag="0FLZ">50.3.4</span>.</a> Let $A$ be a Noetherian ring. Let $X$ be a proper scheme over $S = \mathop{\mathrm{Spec}}(A)$. Then $H^ i_{dR}(X/S)$ is a finite $A$-module for all $i$. </p>
